WEBVTT

00:00:01.200 --> 00:00:04.130
R-R-R-Russi-Russian
R-R-R-Roshi-Roshian

00:00:05.830 --> 00:00:08.200
R-R-R-Russian
R-R-R-Roshian

00:00:15.710 --> 00:00:18.750
Come on down to the secret casino tonight
Konya himitsu no kajino ni oide yo

00:00:18.750 --> 00:00:21.820
Indulge yourself in a fool-hearted game for once
Tamanya mubou na asobi ni yoishire

00:00:21.820 --> 00:00:25.620
But if you get addicted, it might start getting scary
Ochiteyuku you na kibun wa naretara kowai yo

00:00:25.620 --> 00:00:29.560
It's a habit-forming kind of ecstasy
Kuse ni narisou na ekusutashii

00:00:33.000 --> 00:00:38.060
Russian, Russian Roulette
Roshian, Roshian ruuretto

00:00:39.170 --> 00:00:44.040
Paint a bull's-eye on your heart right now
Ima sugu kokoro ni shiro-kuro tsukete

00:00:44.670 --> 00:00:47.640
As she aims that Magnum with its soft shine,
Nibuku hikatta magunamu dakishime

00:00:47.640 --> 00:00:50.750
The cute, elfish girl looks a little scared
Sukoshi obieru kawaii erufin

00:00:50.750 --> 00:00:54.550
Until I take you prisoner, with my life on the line,
Inochi wo kakete anata wo toriko ni suru made

00:00:54.550 --> 00:00:59.150
I'm a dangerous Russian Roulette
Atashi kiken na Roshian ruuretto

00:01:00.590 --> 00:01:03.490
The suspenseful, heart-pounding dance dance
Hara-hara doki-doki dansu dansu

00:01:03.490 --> 00:01:06.730
An exhilarating, thrilling chance chance
Uki-uki waku-waku chansu chansu

00:01:06.730 --> 00:01:09.570
The suspenseful, heart-pounding dance dance
Hara-hara doki-doki dansu dansu

00:01:09.570 --> 00:01:12.800
An exhilarating, thrilling chance chance
Uki-uki waku-waku chansu chansu

00:01:12.800 --> 00:01:15.840
Prepare yourself!
Kakugo wo kimete

00:01:15.840 --> 00:01:18.710
The suspenseful, heart-pounding dance dance
Hara-hara doki-doki dansu dansu

00:01:18.710 --> 00:01:21.910
An exhilarating, thrilling chance chance
Uki-uki waku-waku chansu chansu

00:01:21.910 --> 00:01:24.780
The suspenseful, heart-pounding dance dance
Hara-hara doki-doki dansu dansu

00:01:24.780 --> 00:01:28.270
An exhilarating, thrilling chance chance
Uki-uki waku-waku chansu chansu

00:02:11.160 --> 00:02:14.890
I sense a great power involving your treasure.

00:02:15.560 --> 00:02:16.900
The chip?

00:02:16.900 --> 00:02:20.030
I feel that danger lies ahead...

00:02:20.240 --> 00:02:21.930
That's nothing unusual.

00:02:25.570 --> 00:02:31.540
Go Ahead, Fall In Love!
Love Is Russian Roulette

00:02:36.820 --> 00:02:39.410
Who cares about the Golem Poker Chip?

00:02:39.590 --> 00:02:42.320
Who cares about King's Syndicate?

00:02:42.320 --> 00:02:48.420
Why do we have to go to Planet Vega
just because someone tipped off the 3WA?!

00:02:51.300 --> 00:02:53.070
What the hell is with you?!

00:02:53.070 --> 00:02:56.270
Don't you care that our
vacation has been ruined?!

00:02:56.410 --> 00:02:57.840
That's business for you.

00:02:57.840 --> 00:02:58.910
Oh, shove it!

00:02:58.910 --> 00:03:04.110
Have you forgotten? We swore we'd go topless
on our next vacation, and drive all the men crazy.

00:03:04.110 --> 00:03:05.270
Remember?!

00:03:11.050 --> 00:03:14.760
They say that whoever posses
the Golem Chip becomes unbeatable.

00:03:14.760 --> 00:03:16.560
It also brings incredible wealth.

00:03:16.560 --> 00:03:19.730
Yeah, and countless people have died
trying to get their hands on it.

00:03:19.730 --> 00:03:21.490
At any rate, I don't like it!

00:03:24.100 --> 00:03:27.170
Honestly, couldn't you have gotten
a more lady-like car?!

00:03:27.170 --> 00:03:30.330
This was the only car that Mughi would fit in!

00:03:30.410 --> 00:03:35.880
Anyway, only idiots die chasing down
a crummy gambling chip! Right?

00:03:35.880 --> 00:03:37.570
There, left!

00:03:42.620 --> 00:03:45.090
Who cares about those morons, anyway?

00:03:45.390 --> 00:03:46.580
There, right!

00:03:51.560 --> 00:03:57.170
So why bother the Lovely Angels just to
send them after an old piece of junk?! Jeez!

00:03:57.170 --> 00:03:58.060
Stop!

00:04:00.970 --> 00:04:03.600
This is the casino where King plays every night.

00:04:04.640 --> 00:04:07.810
It's sad how devoted we are to work.

00:04:07.810 --> 00:04:08.710
Right?!

00:04:39.170 --> 00:04:39.980
See him?

00:04:39.980 --> 00:04:41.600
He should be here.

00:04:41.680 --> 00:04:43.230
Are you looking for someone?

00:04:50.050 --> 00:04:55.490
We're looking for Cabrera Carpentier Heir de King.
His name is quite the tongue twister.

00:04:55.490 --> 00:04:57.960
Oh? Do you know the owner?

00:04:58.330 --> 00:05:01.330
Not yet, but we will in an hour.

00:05:01.330 --> 00:05:05.500
Or we could know him in ten minutes,
if you just take us to see him.

00:05:05.500 --> 00:05:09.400
Th-Then why don't we place a bet
and see what happens in ten minutes?

00:05:09.400 --> 00:05:11.270
This is a gambling planet, after all.

00:05:11.270 --> 00:05:12.410
You're on.

00:05:12.410 --> 00:05:15.640
Loser buys dinner. You in?

00:05:15.640 --> 00:05:16.700
Sure.

00:05:17.510 --> 00:05:19.510
Yes! All it takes is a little bit of sex appeal!

00:05:19.510 --> 00:05:20.850
He's just scared of you.

00:05:26.690 --> 00:05:29.090
Win or lose, I have a date.

00:05:29.090 --> 00:05:31.520
You're into lame guys like him?

00:05:31.630 --> 00:05:34.960
So what if I am?!
Just remember, he's mine! Mine!

00:05:34.960 --> 00:05:39.630
I'm not going to steal him.
So would you mind getting off my dress?

00:05:41.500 --> 00:05:43.300
He's right over there.

00:05:58.090 --> 00:06:02.110
Would you care for a game with the
stakes set at thirty thousand credits?

00:06:03.760 --> 00:06:04.990
No way!

00:06:18.640 --> 00:06:23.250
I was just enjoying some
blackjack. Does that suit you?

00:06:23.250 --> 00:06:24.510
Sounds lovely.

00:06:25.810 --> 00:06:28.010
Could we use a new deck?

00:06:31.450 --> 00:06:32.720
Your deal.

00:06:32.820 --> 00:06:34.890
If we win, we'll have sixty thousand credits.

00:06:34.890 --> 00:06:37.930
That's enough for the two of us
to go on a three-year vacation!

00:06:37.930 --> 00:06:40.830
A-And I'm not really considering it,
but that'd be a six-year vacation for one!

00:06:46.870 --> 00:06:47.840
Okay.

00:07:04.590 --> 00:07:06.350
I'll stay.

00:07:06.350 --> 00:07:07.120
Huh?!

00:07:26.410 --> 00:07:27.810
Twenty.

00:07:31.550 --> 00:07:33.210
Twenty! It's a draw!

00:07:33.210 --> 00:07:34.680
We lost.

00:07:35.280 --> 00:07:38.520
The face cards are worth ten,
so I have eighteen.

00:07:38.520 --> 00:07:39.750
Say what?!

00:07:39.750 --> 00:07:41.660
That's too bad.

00:07:41.660 --> 00:07:45.490
Thank you for a wonderful game...
as one might say.

00:07:49.430 --> 00:07:51.520
How is that wonderful?!

00:07:51.800 --> 00:07:53.600
Jeez! Yuri!

00:07:55.740 --> 00:08:00.610
What were you thinking?! Blowing
thirty thousand credits like that!

00:08:00.610 --> 00:08:03.980
Who cares? We can just expense it.

00:08:03.980 --> 00:08:05.780
Ah, right.

00:08:06.080 --> 00:08:06.950
Huh?

00:08:06.950 --> 00:08:09.280
There's no way the Chief will approve that.

00:08:09.380 --> 00:08:11.520
That King guy...

00:08:11.520 --> 00:08:14.280
He was kind of handsome, wasn't he?

00:08:15.090 --> 00:08:17.060
I'm so unlucky.

00:08:17.060 --> 00:08:20.100
My vacation gets canceled,
my partner is a moron...

00:08:20.100 --> 00:08:22.060
What a headache!

00:08:23.200 --> 00:08:24.900
Here he comes.

00:08:24.900 --> 00:08:25.970
My!

00:08:25.970 --> 00:08:28.070
You won the bet.

00:08:28.070 --> 00:08:31.060
The boss wants to invite
you two to his mansion.

00:08:31.370 --> 00:08:32.210
Boss?

00:08:32.210 --> 00:08:36.680
Yes. My name is Sydney,
and I reside at Mr. King's mansion.

00:08:36.680 --> 00:08:37.800
Pleased to meet you.

00:08:38.850 --> 00:08:40.880
Did you know this would happen?

00:08:40.880 --> 00:08:42.110
Sort of.

00:08:42.750 --> 00:08:46.080
We'll gladly accept his invitation.

00:09:03.940 --> 00:09:05.540
His estate starts here.

00:09:05.540 --> 00:09:07.510
What do you mean "starts here"?

00:09:10.150 --> 00:09:12.350
We're driving through his garden now.

00:09:12.350 --> 00:09:14.580
It'll be another six minutes
until we reach the mansion.

00:09:22.190 --> 00:09:24.830
Can't you drive a little more gently?

00:09:24.830 --> 00:09:27.230
My apologies, but the garden is a maze.

00:09:27.430 --> 00:09:28.600
A maze?
A maze?

00:09:28.600 --> 00:09:31.030
For security reasons.
It's to protect the mansion.

00:09:31.030 --> 00:09:33.330
There are other security features, as well.

00:09:33.330 --> 00:09:36.670
This car sends out a recognition
signal while it's in motion.

00:09:36.670 --> 00:09:38.570
If it didn't...

00:09:40.280 --> 00:09:42.800
Sounds like a rat was just caught
in one of the traps somewhere.

00:09:43.710 --> 00:09:45.180
The mansion's coming into view!

00:09:47.350 --> 00:09:50.550
Sir, everyone is waiting
in the recreation room.

00:09:50.920 --> 00:09:53.020
Have them wait a little longer.

00:09:53.020 --> 00:09:53.890
Yes, sir.

00:09:53.890 --> 00:09:58.480
Also, I finished looking up the information
you requested. I shall send it to you now.

00:09:59.830 --> 00:10:02.360
I figured they were no ordinary rats, but...

00:10:02.360 --> 00:10:04.260
So, they're the Dirty Pair.

00:10:05.300 --> 00:10:07.500
This should be an entertaining evening.

00:10:19.410 --> 00:10:21.380
Forgive me, but it's standard procedure.

00:10:30.130 --> 00:10:31.590
Perks of the job, eh?

00:10:32.330 --> 00:10:33.290
Yes.

00:10:39.170 --> 00:10:42.200
Doesn't look like a weapon to me.

00:10:42.200 --> 00:10:43.530
Good luck.

00:10:48.040 --> 00:10:49.840
That was unpleasant.

00:10:50.080 --> 00:10:51.440
We're being watched.

00:10:54.580 --> 00:10:57.710
Everyone, allow me to
introduce tonight's guests.

00:10:57.790 --> 00:10:58.750
Start.

00:11:01.590 --> 00:11:02.420
Bleh!
Bleh!

00:11:04.290 --> 00:11:07.020
Well then, please have your chips ready.

00:11:08.000 --> 00:11:09.300
First, a combat round.

00:11:09.300 --> 00:11:13.000
They will face the demonic creation of
genetic engineering, Kuritaro the Gigantes!

00:11:13.000 --> 00:11:14.660
The odds are even.

00:11:20.580 --> 00:11:22.610
L-Look, it's a guy, Kei!

00:11:22.610 --> 00:11:24.650
H-He's not my type!

00:11:24.650 --> 00:11:25.710
Shoo, shoo!

00:11:25.710 --> 00:11:27.850
He has the hots for you! Look at him!

00:11:27.850 --> 00:11:30.020
You say that about every guy.

00:11:30.020 --> 00:11:32.580
Th-This one's too beefy for my taste!

00:11:35.760 --> 00:11:37.820
I just knew they'd lock us in!

00:11:39.990 --> 00:11:43.190
Ow! H-Hey, let go! I said let go!

00:12:04.420 --> 00:12:06.440
M-Maybe I went too easy on him...

00:12:43.360 --> 00:12:43.960
Nice...

00:12:43.960 --> 00:12:44.820
...play!

00:12:45.290 --> 00:12:45.990
No time...

00:12:45.990 --> 00:12:47.480
...to celebrate!

00:12:57.910 --> 00:12:59.630
Yuri, close your eyes!

00:13:05.010 --> 00:13:06.240
What's going on?!

00:13:06.850 --> 00:13:08.010
Is this rigged?!

00:13:08.150 --> 00:13:10.450
Please, stay calm. It'll be fixed immediately.

00:13:10.450 --> 00:13:12.580
The video circuits seem
to have been burned out.

00:13:12.890 --> 00:13:16.020
I don't need any explanations!
Just fix it! Hurry up!

00:13:28.200 --> 00:13:29.240
Is he dead?

00:13:29.240 --> 00:13:31.360
The most it could do is knock him out.

00:13:32.010 --> 00:13:35.480
Well then, it's about time
Mughi and Nanmo made their move.

00:13:35.480 --> 00:13:38.840
Let's just hope they haven't blown it.

00:13:38.910 --> 00:13:41.140
Have faith in our dear pets.

00:13:41.350 --> 00:13:42.520
I do.

00:13:42.520 --> 00:13:45.610
He pretended not to notice our weapons,
and didn't bother giving us a proper body check...

00:13:45.820 --> 00:13:47.720
Who is that Sydney guy?

00:13:47.790 --> 00:13:49.490
He's been an angel in disguise so far!

00:13:49.490 --> 00:13:53.260
I've been waiting for someone like you.
Don't ever let me go, okay?

00:13:53.260 --> 00:13:55.560
My feelings for you won't change...

00:14:12.080 --> 00:14:13.170
That can't be!

00:14:13.380 --> 00:14:15.850
That's what the fortune says.

00:14:15.850 --> 00:14:19.680
You're saying the 3WA is after my chip?!

00:14:22.620 --> 00:14:25.990
How dare they ruin tonight's game! Hey Sc-

00:14:26.060 --> 00:14:27.360
A monster?!

00:14:27.360 --> 00:14:28.760
Preposterous!

00:14:28.860 --> 00:14:30.770
I'll go check on it.

00:14:30.770 --> 00:14:32.460
Don't get involved, old woman!

00:14:42.940 --> 00:14:46.210
Multiple hostiles approaching!
The mansion has been completely surrounded!

00:14:46.450 --> 00:14:48.210
The security system isn't working!

00:14:48.680 --> 00:14:51.980
Don't be deceived by false information!
It must be their doing!

00:14:52.450 --> 00:14:53.550
What are you doing?!

00:15:00.730 --> 00:15:01.920
It's not working.

00:15:03.970 --> 00:15:04.530
Good thinking!

00:15:04.530 --> 00:15:05.230
Let's go!
Good thinking!

00:15:06.170 --> 00:15:07.500
You're so cool!

00:15:10.000 --> 00:15:12.170
Nanmo! Send me your current location!

00:15:16.180 --> 00:15:18.280
Just who are you?!

00:15:18.280 --> 00:15:21.370
Didn't your superiors
tell you to cooperate with me?

00:15:21.520 --> 00:15:22.710
Huh?!
Huh?!

00:15:23.020 --> 00:15:25.050
Do you know where the chip is located?

00:15:25.050 --> 00:15:26.020
We sure do.

00:15:26.220 --> 00:15:27.760
I should have known.

00:15:27.760 --> 00:15:30.860
But the chip is protected by laser beams.

00:15:30.860 --> 00:15:34.160
We're the ones controlling the security system now!

00:15:34.160 --> 00:15:35.360
It's useless.

00:15:35.460 --> 00:15:39.000
The security system and the barrier
protecting the chip are separate.

00:15:39.000 --> 00:15:40.840
But there is a way.

00:15:40.840 --> 00:15:42.840
All we have to do is stop
the "heart" of this mansion.

00:15:42.840 --> 00:15:43.930
The heart?!

00:15:45.040 --> 00:15:46.870
If we stop the dedicated fusion reactor...

00:15:46.870 --> 00:15:48.880
That'll stop all the systems in the mansion?

00:15:48.880 --> 00:15:50.000
Including the barrier!

00:15:50.310 --> 00:15:51.250
Nanmo!

00:15:51.250 --> 00:15:53.210
Do you know where the fusion reactor is?

00:15:57.190 --> 00:15:58.450
It's the armored security force!

00:15:58.450 --> 00:15:59.450
We can get past them!

00:15:59.450 --> 00:16:00.920
There's too many of them.

00:16:01.090 --> 00:16:02.890
I'll stay here and buy us time.

00:16:02.890 --> 00:16:05.130
Kei, you stop the fusion reactor.
Yuri, you get the chip!

00:16:05.130 --> 00:16:05.630
Okay!

00:16:05.630 --> 00:16:06.120
Fine!

00:16:10.630 --> 00:16:13.130
Sir, as a precaution,
please prepare to evacuate.

00:16:13.130 --> 00:16:15.400
Scarl, how about a bet?

00:16:15.400 --> 00:16:16.130
Huh?

00:16:16.270 --> 00:16:21.540
Whether those two will fail,
or if my men will go down first...

00:16:21.540 --> 00:16:23.840
That would be a life-or-death bet, sir.

00:16:24.710 --> 00:16:27.310
A high stakes game
always requires such a wager.

00:17:04.520 --> 00:17:06.750
Fusion reactor stopped.

00:17:09.690 --> 00:17:11.920
Self-destruct mechanism activated.

00:17:12.430 --> 00:17:14.830
Ten minutes until detonation.

00:17:14.830 --> 00:17:15.630
What?!

00:17:18.530 --> 00:17:19.830
Where'd all these people come from?!

00:17:19.830 --> 00:17:21.500
Where were they before?!

00:17:21.600 --> 00:17:23.870
This will make our job much easier!

00:17:42.160 --> 00:17:42.960
A button?

00:17:42.960 --> 00:17:43.920
Found it!

00:17:44.260 --> 00:17:45.390
It's mine!

00:17:45.390 --> 00:17:47.900
Great job! Congratulations!

00:17:47.900 --> 00:17:48.830
Gotcha!

00:17:55.040 --> 00:17:56.500
Sydney?

00:17:56.600 --> 00:18:00.300
Sorry, I forgot to tell you
about the self-destruct mechanism.

00:18:00.370 --> 00:18:01.980
You came back just to tell us that?

00:18:01.980 --> 00:18:03.140
Yeah...

00:18:05.080 --> 00:18:07.250
We have less than five
minutes until it explodes.

00:18:07.250 --> 00:18:08.820
You go alone.

00:18:08.820 --> 00:18:11.450
At this rate, the whole estate will explode.

00:18:11.450 --> 00:18:15.490
But, if I activate the control system,
only the mansion will blow.

00:18:15.490 --> 00:18:16.110
But!

00:18:19.590 --> 00:18:21.630
You don't know how to operate
the control system, right?

00:18:21.630 --> 00:18:22.130
Y-You made the first move...
You don't know how to operate
the control system, right?

00:18:22.130 --> 00:18:23.360
Y-You made the first move...

00:18:23.360 --> 00:18:23.560
Y-You made the first move...
I still owe you dinner, don't I?

00:18:23.560 --> 00:18:25.700
I still owe you dinner, don't I?

00:18:25.700 --> 00:18:28.730
My bets don't go unpaid.
Especially to you!

00:18:30.910 --> 00:18:33.140
He's sweet...

00:18:33.140 --> 00:18:35.200
...but everything he says is so corny.

00:18:46.790 --> 00:18:47.890
What's happening?!

00:18:47.890 --> 00:18:48.980
Is it an earthquake?!

00:19:03.440 --> 00:19:04.040
Hey, you!

00:19:04.040 --> 00:19:04.310
Long time no see!
Hey, you!

00:19:04.310 --> 00:19:05.270
Long time no see!

00:19:35.300 --> 00:19:38.290
That was pretty klutzy of you to grab a fake.

00:19:38.540 --> 00:19:42.270
It's not my fault! It was total chaos in there.

00:19:44.980 --> 00:19:55.250
All passengers for Flight 305 departing at 7:50
for Planet Tarna, please go to Gate 5 immediately.

00:19:55.660 --> 00:19:59.560
The check-in window will soon be closing.

00:19:59.830 --> 00:20:03.660
So when are you treating me
to that dinner, Sydney?

00:20:10.670 --> 00:20:13.670
Hand over the real chip, Sydney.

00:20:13.670 --> 00:20:17.010
Or should we call you, "Old Woman"?

00:20:17.010 --> 00:20:18.710
Stop playing dumb.

00:20:18.950 --> 00:20:19.780
Found it!

00:20:21.220 --> 00:20:22.420
When did you figure it out?

00:20:22.420 --> 00:20:26.850
You must use a lot of hair gel
to grease your hair back like that.

00:20:26.850 --> 00:20:30.050
I smelled that same gel
when the old lady passed by.

00:20:31.330 --> 00:20:34.630
You also lied about the
entire estate blowing up, didn't you?

00:20:34.630 --> 00:20:37.060
Disguised as the old woman,
you infiltrated King's estate.

00:20:37.060 --> 00:20:41.540
After winning his trust, you waited for the
right opportunity to steal his chip. And then...

00:20:41.540 --> 00:20:46.440
You anonymously tipped off the 3WA
and managed to get us to help you!

00:20:46.440 --> 00:20:47.910
Four... Four years!

00:20:47.910 --> 00:20:51.910
For four long years, I pretended
to be Sydney and that old hag!

00:20:51.910 --> 00:20:53.280
It was so strenuous!

00:20:54.380 --> 00:20:56.580
Jeez, you're such a ham.

00:20:58.020 --> 00:21:02.920
But thanks to me, that chip is going to be returned
to the museum, so it was all worth it, right?

00:21:02.920 --> 00:21:04.320
Speak for yourself.
Speak for yourself.

